{"id":107946054053457,"name":"Survive in the Facility Revamp","desc":"Welcome to Survive in the Facility Revamp!\n\n2x DNA in weekends UTC Time!\n\nPS: Certain users are able to update games without ID for now, may release some patches here and there.\n\nInspired by Nebulalition's Survive in the Facility and PenguinDoc9999's Survive in Area 51.\n\nCheck In-Game Changelogs or our Community Server for changes! (Your account must be 3 days or older)\n\n🔴Your task is simple, explore what lies in the facility and uncover what lurks within the depths of the halls!\n🔴Earn DNA points by exterminating creatures with abnormal natures!\n🔴Discover enemies with a myriad of abilities and gimmicks!\n🔴Explore and locate brand new weapons to expand your arsenal!\n\nLIKE & FAVOURITE this game to support the creator!\n\nGame may not be suited for Console!\n\nCredits to Nebulalition for approving of this game and creating Survive in the Facility!\n\nContributors: Helios, Xevnai, Sarcasm, Sapphire, Maxi\nTags:Zombie, Area 51, Survive, Survival, Facility, Killer, Horror, Monster, Area, Scary","path":"/game/107946054053457-survive-in-the-facility-revamp","slug":"107946054053457-survive-in-the-facility-revamp","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1a8cc993172dc6569e01bac06670193ce094c0fa3c9a952b479a27ef1cbea982.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e749b84ef841da2f150e2a4bbed4caee/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":52,"visitor":3708071,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-09T16:32:40.996Z","creator":{"name":"Aughzure","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"69d7d4a8e52e8dc73fa32f93","title":"Open Source","game":{"_id":"69d52ae0e52e8dc73f6d5932","gameId":107946054053457,"name":"Survive in the Facility Revamp","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/96678d74fb38d330e04fad01f6c699e7121638b0944d08e726ef4d9f5e693e70.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-aeece82cc2a74bf2bb4452bb765add50-f5c1af5b49d1.png"},"slug":"107946054053457-survive-in-the-facility-revamp","path":"/game/107946054053457-survive-in-the-facility-revamp","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/96678d74fb38d330e04fad01f6c699e7121638b0944d08e726ef4d9f5e693e70.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-aeece82cc2a74bf2bb4452bb765add50-f5c1af5b49d1.png"},"placeId":107946054053457},"slug":"Survive-in-the-Facility-Revamp-Open-Source-195552","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":1767,"executes":1042,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/14a5c9d93e09f98b686452fbeaefa3df03b0a170285018deb936d59507703100.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/107946054053457-1775752360985.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/107946054053457-1775752360985.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/14a5c9d93e09f98b686452fbeaefa3df03b0a170285018deb936d59507703100.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/107946054053457-1775752360985.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/107946054053457-1775752360985.png"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-04-09T16:32:40.996Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-09T16:32:40.996Z","lastBump":"2026-04-09T16:32:40.996Z","script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal player = Players.LocalPlayer\n\nlocal function updatetool()\n    local backpack = player:WaitForChild(\"Backpack\")\n\n    for _, tool in ipairs(backpack:GetChildren()) do\n        if tool:IsA(\"Tool\") and tool:FindFirstChild(\"Settings\") then\n            local module = tool.Settings\n            local r = require(module)\n            r.Auto = true\n            r.Firerate = 0.05\n            r.ReloadTime = 0\n            r.Explosive = true\n            r.Spread = 0\n            r.CameraShakeEnabled = false\n            r.ExplosionRadius = 99999\n        end\n    end\nend\nupdatetool()\n\nplayer.CharacterAdded:Connect(function()\n    task.wait(0.5)\n    updatetool()\nend)","features":"the script does this:\n- Increases Firerate\n- Makes your bullets do explosive damage across the entire map (set ExplosionRadius to 15 to get it normal again)\n-Decreases Reload Time\n- Removes Bullet Spread Completely\n- Makes all guns fully automatic\nNote: You can change whatever you want on it, don't set the Firerate below 0.03 or you will get kicked by the anti-cheat.\nScript made by me (If you want more scripts for a specific game, comment below <3)","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"699758acf0045c3983d2061a","username":"CryMeSomeWaves","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"699758acf0045c3983d2061a","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T02:39:37.303Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69d7d4a8e52e8dc73fa32f96","editBy":{"_id":"699758acf0045c3983d2061a","username":"CryMeSomeWaves","status":"offline","id":"699758acf0045c3983d2061a"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-04-09T16:32:41.000Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69d7db97e52e8dc73fa3adcf","commentBy":{"_id":"667043caa7710158a45a54b1","username":"elijahyoungd","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2024-06-17T14:10:18.128Z","lastActive":"2026-09-08T19:26:13.253Z","status":"offline","id":"667043caa7710158a45a54b1","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"What executor is th